                <pb facs="0784" n="700" xml:id="pg700"/>

                <head>No. 315.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Brigham to Mr. Porter.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Consulate</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Paso del
                                Norte</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1886-07-17"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 17, 1886</date>. (Received July
                        19.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Cutting still in prison; nothing done by local authorities. Can’t immediate
                    unconditional release <hi rendition="#italic">be</hi> demanded?</p>
                <closer><signed>BRIGHAM,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Consul.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
